  "limitations": [
    "All account authentication, password changes, recovery, approvals, deletion, exports and sync operations are inert in-memory demonstrations. Never enter real secrets.",
    "Connections use fixture provider capabilities, receipt/progress/import and export data; no OAuth, tokens, credentials, service requests or clipboard writes occur.",
    "Activity uses three deterministic sample records; no native ActivityStore or real user history is read.",
    "Wallpaper native animated scene is a labeled static preview; public search/pagination is limited to bundled local images. Preview selection is stored only in the mock session.",
    "Settings is an integration utility surface for native preferences. ContentPreferences.showExplicit is read-only true in the pinned source, and is shown disabled rather than inventing a working toggle.",
    "Update gallery uses labeled DEMO release chapters and deterministic native-state projections, without real version claims, download, signature verification or installation.",
    "Native save-file export dialogs are represented by a reviewable fixture export; no external account or local media is touched."
  ]
}
